      "description": "Watch Real Madrid vs Real Sociedad highlights and goals from La Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 26, 2026. The bright lights of the Santiago Bernabéu set the stage on August 26, 2026 , for a highly anticipated La Liga clash. With over 72,000 fans in attendance, both Real Madrid and Real Sociedad sought to establish their dominance in a match that promised tactical depth and individual brilliance. A Tense Exchange Before the Break The opening period was a cagey affair, punctuated by physical challenges and early bookings for the visitors. Real Madrid finally broke the deadlock in the 40th minute when Federico Valverde teed up Kylian Mbappé , who clinically dispatched a left-footed strike. However, the lead was short-lived. Real Sociedad displayed remarkable resilience, equalizing just four minutes later through Luka Sucic , who reacted quickest to a loose ball to fire home and send the teams into the tunnel level at 1-1. Mbappé Takes Center Stage The second half belonged entirely to the hosts as they ramped up the pressure. In the 60th minute, Jude Bellingham provided the vision for Kylian Mbappé to restore the lead with a composed right-footed finish. The momentum shifted further in Madrid's favor when a defensive lapse by Luken Beitia in the 68th minute allowed Vinicius Junior to tap in a third, once again assisted by the influential Bellingham . The visitors struggled to contain the waves of white shirts as the game entered its final stages. Kylian Mbappé saved his best for last, completing a stunning hat-trick in the 80th minute with an audacious lob following a pass from Vinicius Junior . While Brahim Diaz saw a late effort ruled out by VAR for an offside involving Carlos Espi , and Eduardo Camavinga received a late yellow card for violent conduct, the result was never in doubt. Real Madrid walked away with a deserved victory after a fine display of attacking football."
